OL,3,ATycoon to pay ex-wife $1.87bn in record
OL,4,ASouth Korea divorce settlement
OL,5,
OL,6,FSmilegate was wholly owned by him until
OL,7,FWednesday when a court ruled that a 35%
OL,8,Fstake, valued at about 2.5tr won, be
OL,9,Ftransferred to his wife Lee Hwa-jin. He
OL,10,Fwas also ordered to pay her an
OL,11,Fadditional 65bn won in cash.
OL,13,FThis settlement is more than double the
OL,14,Fprevious record of 944bn won which tech
OL,15,Ftitan Chey Tae-won was ordered to pay
OL,16,Fhis ex-wife.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
